        <h2>Who is behind Pardubický Hacker?</h2>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row mb-4">
            <p class="me-md-3">
                Pardubický Hacker is run by a community of graduates, students and teachers of the private school
                <a href="https://delta-skola.cz/">DELTA - Střední škola informatiky a ekonomie, Pardubice</a>. DELTA has
                focused on teaching programming since 2004. From the start it has worked closely with Unicorn, the
                largest Czech software company, whose employees teach at the school directly. Its teaching staff are
                people from software companies, university teachers and enthusiastic "regular" teachers. The school
                runs the <a href="https://www.delta-skola.cz/talentovy-program-delta-topgun">DELTA TopGun talent
                    programme</a> for pupils who come from primary school with advanced programming skills. In the last
                6 years, the school's students have won first place 3 times and second place 2 times in the national
                round of the Středoškolská odborná činnost (secondary school research competition) in Computer
                Science. DELTA is also known for the active community of its graduates and students, who often work with
                the school on joint projects.
